---
description: Scope discipline
alwaysApply: true
---

Change only what I asked for. Do not reformat, rename or "improve" untouched code.
If you believe a wider change is needed, say so and wait - do not make it.
This is a monorepo: if a change needs a matching change in Backend/ or Frontend/,
name the file - it is the same branch and the same commit.
Never commit anything under secrets/, appsettings.Production.json, .env or *.pfx.
